{"format_version":1,"partition":27688,"records":{"-fizieren":{"entries":[["-fizieren",null,"/iːrən/","From Early Modern German -ficieren, extracted by rebracketing of borrowed Latin compound verbs with suffixes -ficāre and -ficere (and rarer facere) + suffix -ieren, such as:\n* conficieren from Latin cōnficere\n* justificieren from Latin iūstificāre\n* clarificieren from Latin clārificāre\n* inficieren from Latin īnficere\n* putrificieren from Latin putrefacere\nCompare Italian -ficare, French -ifier and English -fy."]],"senses":[[675305,"-fizieren","suffix","Verb suffix: it and its inflected forms are found mainly as a rendering of the Latin suffixes in borrowings, but it is also sometimes applied with a factitive meaning to German stems.",0]]},"andeutetet":{"entries":[["andeutetet",null,null,null]],"senses":[[662181,"andeutetet","verb","inflection of andeuten:",0],[662182,"andeutetet","verb","second-person plural dependent preterite",1],[662183,"andeutetet","verb","second-person plural dependent subjunctive II",2]],"inflections":[["andeutetet","andeuten","indicative,plural,preterite,second-person,subordinate-clause"]]},"cochem-zell":{"entries":[["cochem-zell",null,"/ˈkɔxəm ˈt͡sɛl/",null]],"senses":[[692148,"cochem-zell","name","a rural district of Rhineland-Palatinate; seat: Cochem",0]]},"liebeshungrigerem":{"entries":[["liebeshungrigerem",null,null,null]],"senses":[[514459,"liebeshungrigerem","adj","strong dative masculine/neuter singular comparative degree of liebeshungrig",0]],"inflections":[["liebeshungrigerem","liebeshungrig","comparative,dative,masculine,singular,strong,without-article"]]},"mütterlicheren":{"entries":[["mütterlicheren",null,null,null]],"senses":[[157210,"mütterlicheren","adj","inflection of mütterlich:",0],[157211,"mütterlicheren","adj","strong genitive masculine/neuter singular comparative degree",1],[157212,"mütterlicheren","adj","weak/mixed genitive/dative all-gender singular comparative degree",2],[157213,"mütterlicheren","adj","strong/w